* text=auto
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf

# Keep the contract source byte-identical to what was verified on chain.
#
# The metadata hash inside the deployed bytecode is a hash of the source text,
# so a line-ending change (CRLF → LF) produces different runtime bytecode and
# the Sourcify / BscScan "exact match" no longer reproduces. Store it verbatim.
# NOTE: this rule must come last — in .gitattributes the last matching rule wins.
src/OneDraw.sol -text
